                ]
              ],
              "hint": "Simplified diagrams.",
              "explanation": "Schematics are simplified forms of networks or circuits."
            },
            {
              "type": "fill_in_the_blank",
              "question": "A ____ of drawings for a large project can consist of hundreds of pages.",
