          "id": "u6_l2",
          "title": "Pipe dimensions",
          "theory": "Specific terms are used for pipes:\n\n* **Inside Diameter (ID)** or **Bore**: The internal width.\n* **Outside Diameter (OD)**: The external width.\n* **Crown**: The top of the outside of a horizontal pipe.\n* **Invert**: The bottom of the inside of a horizontal pipe.",
          "exercises": [
