        {
          "id": "u8_l2",
          "title": "Basic operations",
          "theory": "Standard terms for calculations include:\n\n* **Plus** / **Sum**: Addition (+).\n* **Minus** / **Less** / **Subtract**: Subtraction (-).\n* **Times** / **Multiplied by**: Multiplication (x).\n* **Divided by**: Division (÷).\n* **Squared**: Raised to the power of 2 (e.g., 3²).\n* **Square root**: The value that, when squared, gives the number (e.g., √9).",
