          "id": "u11_l3",
          "title": "Composite materials",
          "theory": "Composites consist of a **matrix** and **reinforcement**:\n\n* **Matrix**: The surrounding material (e.g., plastic).\n* **Reinforcement**: The structural network inside (e.g., glass fibres).\n* **Examples**: \n    * Bricks (mud matrix, straw reinforcement).\n    * Fibreglass / GRP (plastic matrix, glass fibre reinforcement).\n    * Reinforced concrete (concrete matrix, steel reinforcement).",
