          "id": "u21_l2",
          "title": "Processed formats",
          "theory": "Materials are supplied in ready-to-use formats:\n\n* **Bars**: Solid long lengths (round/rod, square, flat).\n* **Sheets**: Flat, wide, thin (<3mm for steel). Wood sheets are **boards**; metal sheets come in **coils**.\n* **Plates**: Flat, wide, thick (>3mm for steel).\n* **Sections**: Structural shapes (e.g., I-sections).\n* **Tubes**: Hollow lengths. **Pipes** carry liquid/gas.\n* **Wires**: Single strands of metal. Combined wires form a **cable**.",
