                },
                {
                  "text": "Seal",
                  "is_correct": false
                },
                {
                  "text": "Adjustment",
                  "is_correct": false
                }
              ],
              "explanation": "Play allows for tolerances and movement but must be controlled."
            },
            {
              "type": "fill_in_the_blank",
              "question": "Parts that don't line up won't (1) ____ properly. Joints must be (2) ____ against rainwater.",
