          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "u38_l2",
          "title": "Hydrostatic pressure",
          "theory": "Pressure from height:\n\n* **Hydrostatic pressure**: Generated by the weight of a liquid column.\n* **Head of water**: The height of water above a point.\n* **Header tank**: A tank at a high level to provide pressure.",
          "exercises": [
