          "title": "Conversion of motion",
          "theory": "Linear to rotary:\n\n* **Connecting rod** (**conrod**): Joins the piston to the crankshaft.\n* **Crankshaft**: Converts reciprocating motion of pistons into rotary motion.\n* **Flywheel**: A heavy wheel providing **momentum** for constant motion.\n* **Camshaft**: Rotates to open and close valves via **cams** and **followers**.",
          "exercises": [
